    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'm thinking of implementing a week of reduced intensity, but I'm worried about them losing momentum or feeling like they're losing progress. Is there a specific way to structure the volume during a deload to ensure they're actually recovering the CNS without just losing the stimulus?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
